The '''Spring Depths''' is a [[Location]] found within the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}} on the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}. 

{{ZoneText|Gather more &aSea Lumies&f.|Use your &9Fishing Net &fto &eHunt&f.|Swim down deeper into the &9Spring Depths&f.}}
== Features ==
The '''Spring Depths''' represents the lower portion of the tall body of water that makes up the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}. Players can find {{MobSprite|Water Snake}}s, {{MobSprite|Solar}}s, {{MobSprite|Ember}}s, and {{MobSprite|Sepialot}}s, all of which can be [[Hunting|hunted]] using a [[Fishing Net]]. 

There are also several pathways, including one that leads to a {{Item|Fairy Soul}}, one for the {{Zone|Ant's Cave}}, and one for the {{Zone|Hotspot Haven}}. At the bottom of the water, players can find a puzzle to access the {{Zone|Desert Temple}}.

